declarations.docstring:
A Kan complex `S` satisfies the following horn-filling condition:
for every nonzero `n : ℕ` and `0 ≤ i ≤ n`,
every map of simplicial sets `σ₀ : Λ[n, i] → S` can be extended to a map `σ : Δ[n] → S`.

